'''Cress Williams''' {{born|26|July|1970}} is an actor who played [[Talak'talan]] in the {{s|DS9}} [[DS9 Season 2|second season]] episode {{e|The Jem'Hadar}}.

Williams is perhaps best known for playing Wyatt Matthewson in {{wt|Prison Break}}, Lavon Hayes in {{wt|Hart of Dixie}}, and {{w|Black Lightning|Black Lightning / Jefferson Pierce}} in [[DC Comics]]' {{wt|Black Lightning (TV series)|Black Lightning}} from 2018 to 2021.

Williams has had recurring roles in {{wt|Beverly Hills, 90210}}, {{wt|ER (TV series)|ER}}, {{wt|Providence (American TV series)|Providence}}, {{wt|Prison Break}} (with [[Wade Andrew Williams]] and [[Robert Knepper]]), {{wt|Veronica Mars}}, Tucker Jones in ''Gray's Anatomy'', {{wt|Nash Bridges}}, {{wt|Friday Night Lights (TV series)|Friday Night Lights}}, and {{wt|Living Single}}. Williams has guest starred in {{wt|Becker (TV series)|Becker}} (with [[Terry Farrell]]), {{wt|The West Wing}}, {{wt|Cold Case}} and {{wt|Hawthorne (TV series)|Hawthorne}}.

Williams has appeared in films such as ''Fallen'' and ''Never Been Kissed''. {{el|http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/live-feed/cress-williams-set-as-black-lightning-cws-greg-berlanti-dc-drama-979515}}

