'''Paul Francis Tompkins''' {{born|12|September|1968}} is an American actor, comedian, and writer who voiced [[Dr.]] [[Gabers Migleemo]] in {{s|LD}}, as well as other characters in the series.

He also co-hosted ''[[Star Trek: The Pod Directive]]'' with ''Lower Decks'' co-star [[Tawny Newsome]], who, along with [[Eugene Cordero]], has been a frequent guest on his comedy podcasts. In 2007, he starred in four episodes of ''The Sarah Silverman Program'' with [[Sarah Silverman]]. In 2010, he was a guest star on {{wt|Community (TV series)|Community}}, starring [[Danny Pudi]] and [[Gillian Jacobs]], in an episode that also featured [[Tig Notaro]]. He reunited with Pudi in 2017 for {{wt|DuckTales (2017 TV series)|DuckTales}}. In 2020, he starred in an episode of ''The Twilight Zone'' that also featured Tawny Newsome.
